WEBVTT

00:00:23.690 --> 00:00:25.510
We were warned.

00:00:26.380 --> 00:00:29.760
I should've been able to prevent
the "dead face" footage.

00:00:30.760 --> 00:00:31.880
Kuze?

00:00:33.410 --> 00:00:36.340
I let my guard down.

00:00:37.800 --> 00:00:39.970
You can't think like that.

00:00:40.690 --> 00:00:42.180
It ain't your fault.

00:00:47.950 --> 00:00:49.400
Wh-What?

00:00:50.490 --> 00:00:51.280
The hell?

00:00:52.700 --> 00:00:54.380
Please come with us.

00:00:55.330 --> 00:01:00.040
Bureau Chief

00:00:56.060 --> 00:00:59.020
Hibiki, the Septentrion have appeared.

00:00:59.020 --> 00:01:00.200
Get in position.

00:03:14.260 --> 00:03:15.340
Fire a volley!

00:03:41.290 --> 00:03:42.450
I get it.

00:03:42.790 --> 00:03:47.700
They can appear in this manner now that
the city's lost defensive capabilities.

00:03:48.300 --> 00:03:51.110
It seems rather severe.

00:03:51.750 --> 00:03:53.830
Do you think the humans have
a chance of winning?

00:03:54.800 --> 00:03:56.840
If this is enough to beat them,

00:03:57.620 --> 00:04:02.020
then unfortunately,
it spells the end for humanity.

00:04:07.140 --> 00:04:08.230
What's that?!

00:04:08.230 --> 00:04:09.270
A monster?

00:04:10.430 --> 00:04:11.690
Tank squadron is destroyed!

00:04:12.050 --> 00:04:15.850
The Septentrion Merak is currently
heading south via Shin-Osaka!

00:04:16.820 --> 00:04:17.860
Is that so?

00:04:18.220 --> 00:04:21.360
Then our no-good government is finished.

00:04:21.870 --> 00:04:25.990
We will now eliminate the enemy
using JP's firepower. Begin.

00:04:26.840 --> 00:04:28.000
Initiate.

00:04:28.000 --> 00:04:28.580
Ma'am!

00:04:35.050 --> 00:04:39.780
Now that we've lost spiritual defenses,
the enemy has fully manifested itself.

00:04:39.780 --> 00:04:44.400
Its firepower is probably 10
times what we expected.

00:04:45.410 --> 00:04:46.760
Ten times...

00:04:47.080 --> 00:04:50.560
Merak's goal is Osaka's spiritual barrier,
Tsutenkaku.

00:04:50.980 --> 00:04:53.980
If we lose that, Osaka will be finished.

00:04:54.480 --> 00:04:57.860
Place a Summoner platoon
in Merak's travel route.

00:04:58.160 --> 00:05:00.980
Then, attack with all the strength of
the Osaka Main Bureau!

00:05:01.990 --> 00:05:03.700
A human wall.

00:05:06.590 --> 00:05:08.830
What do you mean, "No"?

00:05:08.830 --> 00:05:10.280
Hibiki's already gone, right?

00:05:10.710 --> 00:05:12.500
Why can't I go?!

00:05:12.850 --> 00:05:14.710
Your demons' levels are too low.

00:05:15.440 --> 00:05:16.490
I can't permit it.

00:05:19.300 --> 00:05:20.000
Hey.

00:05:22.900 --> 00:05:24.260
You're on the medevac team.

00:05:26.220 --> 00:05:27.010
Gotcha!

00:05:30.100 --> 00:05:31.510
About Keita...

00:05:31.940 --> 00:05:36.560
Yesterday, when I was pinned down by
rubble and couldn't move,

00:05:36.560 --> 00:05:38.150
he helped me.

00:05:38.610 --> 00:05:40.740
He used the Berserk to move the rubble.

00:05:41.760 --> 00:05:44.330
The people watching sure freaked out.

00:05:45.040 --> 00:05:50.410
Then JP's hauled us in, told us not
to use demons in front of others...

00:05:51.000 --> 00:05:53.000
The rest is the same as you all.

00:05:53.830 --> 00:05:55.130
Hinako...

00:05:58.050 --> 00:05:59.550
We're ordered to move out.

00:05:59.550 --> 00:06:00.530
Can you go?

00:06:03.680 --> 00:06:04.660
Okay!

00:06:05.090 --> 00:06:06.170
You're going?

00:06:06.560 --> 00:06:07.800
You see...

00:06:08.570 --> 00:06:10.390
I can't just sit still.

00:06:10.810 --> 00:06:13.060
Well, neither can I!

00:06:13.460 --> 00:06:14.650
Io Nitta.

00:06:14.650 --> 00:06:16.900
You're ordered to stay on standby.

00:06:16.900 --> 00:06:18.960
Huh? But why?

00:06:19.430 --> 00:06:21.020
It's the Bureau Chief's orders.

00:06:22.570 --> 00:06:23.740
Nitta?

00:06:24.620 --> 00:06:27.250
You just stay here next to Hibiki.

00:06:28.660 --> 00:06:32.740
He thinks that Keita's
dyin' is his fault.

00:06:33.660 --> 00:06:35.310
Even though that's not the case.

00:06:38.550 --> 00:06:41.670
Hibiki. You're the last line of defense

00:06:42.040 --> 00:06:43.770
You MUST stop it.

00:06:45.970 --> 00:06:46.980
What is it?

00:06:47.610 --> 00:06:51.180
Keita died protecting me.

00:06:51.520 --> 00:06:53.470
It's an acceptable sacrifice.

00:06:53.810 --> 00:06:55.290
Sacrifice?

00:06:55.940 --> 00:06:58.160
I can't think of it like that.

00:06:58.840 --> 00:07:00.430
Then quit.

00:07:00.430 --> 00:07:02.790
Those who lack the
will to fight are useless.

00:07:03.200 --> 00:07:04.230
You...!

00:07:04.720 --> 00:07:08.260
Sir. Up till yesterday,
he was just a civilian.

00:07:08.630 --> 00:07:09.920
Irrelevant.

00:07:09.920 --> 00:07:14.240
Splendid abilities notwithstanding,
if he can't use them, he's garbage.

00:07:14.790 --> 00:07:16.310
I won't quit.

00:07:17.720 --> 00:07:18.960
I'll use my power...

00:07:19.980 --> 00:07:21.880
to protect others.

00:07:22.390 --> 00:07:25.990
I can't allow any more sacrifices!

00:07:39.860 --> 00:07:42.390
Give it no quarter! Keep attacking!

00:07:42.990 --> 00:07:44.700
Stay close to your demons.

00:07:44.700 --> 00:07:45.940
Keep your control distance!

00:07:50.280 --> 00:07:51.110
What the?!

00:08:04.670 --> 00:08:07.670
The Umeda Defensive
Line... is annihilated.

00:08:09.510 --> 00:08:11.670
How are we on reinstating
spiritual defenses?

00:08:12.810 --> 00:08:15.180
Currently at 10% restoration.

00:08:15.500 --> 00:08:18.320
They've done well in a
short amount of time.

00:08:25.470 --> 00:08:26.700
Kuze...

00:08:38.750 --> 00:08:39.750
You!

00:08:41.780 --> 00:08:43.280
You were ordered to be on stand--

00:08:43.280 --> 00:08:44.960
Oh! Where's Kuze?!

00:08:45.370 --> 00:08:48.750
H-He's on the roof of
that building over there.

00:08:50.050 --> 00:08:51.310
Thank you very much.

00:08:51.310 --> 00:08:52.210
Hey!

00:09:00.650 --> 00:09:02.520
Merak's magical readings are increasing!

00:09:12.160 --> 00:09:13.870
Emergency retreat! Hurry!

00:09:14.370 --> 00:09:15.320
Here it comes.

00:09:44.060 --> 00:09:45.230
Situation update, stat!

00:09:45.230 --> 00:09:46.530
Communications are down!

00:09:46.530 --> 00:09:48.310
What about survivors?!

00:09:49.700 --> 00:09:50.800
They're dead.

00:09:52.580 --> 00:09:54.210
They're all dead.

00:10:02.500 --> 00:10:04.000
It's frozen.

00:10:05.880 --> 00:10:07.510
Even the medevac team.

00:10:07.900 --> 00:10:10.860
Without the helpers,
we can't give any aid!

00:10:15.710 --> 00:10:16.470
Hibiki!

00:10:16.470 --> 00:10:17.770
Get outta there now!

00:10:17.770 --> 00:10:20.340
You don't gotta hold their hands, right?

00:10:21.310 --> 00:10:22.980
You've done enough!

00:10:22.980 --> 00:10:25.930
If you do what JP's
says, you'll get killed!

00:10:25.930 --> 00:10:28.160
You can hear me, right?
He's a nuisance. Cut the channel.

00:10:28.160 --> 00:10:29.360
Say something!

00:10:29.360 --> 00:10:31.480
Hibiki... Hibiki!

00:10:33.120 --> 00:10:35.050
I'm going.

00:10:36.150 --> 00:10:37.810
You're to remain here.

00:10:39.100 --> 00:10:40.200
Please move.

00:10:40.200 --> 00:10:41.500
I can't.

00:10:41.500 --> 00:10:44.500
But I can fight it with Byakko's power.

00:10:45.330 --> 00:10:46.710
You can hear, can't you?

00:10:47.210 --> 00:10:49.500
Why didn't you use me from the start?

00:10:50.180 --> 00:10:53.890
If you had, they...
wouldn't have had to die.

00:10:54.800 --> 00:10:59.510
There's still too much we don't know
about the enemy's capabilities.

00:10:59.510 --> 00:11:02.140
We can't send you in
there without a plan.

00:11:02.140 --> 00:11:04.680
That's exactly why I can't stay still!

00:11:05.010 --> 00:11:09.020
Kuze. You're getting
unable to think clearly.

00:11:09.020 --> 00:11:10.770
I can't give you permission.

00:11:11.440 --> 00:11:13.740
I don't need permission!

00:11:14.950 --> 00:11:17.400
We're shut out of communications.

00:11:17.400 --> 00:11:18.540
Bureau Chief...

00:11:19.320 --> 00:11:20.530
Imbecile.

00:11:21.330 --> 00:11:22.280
Never mind.

00:11:22.280 --> 00:11:24.210
A replacement has been readied.

00:11:28.840 --> 00:11:31.370
You can try to stop me, but I'm going.

00:11:32.880 --> 00:11:33.750
Byakko!

00:12:05.060 --> 00:12:06.190
Here it comes.

00:12:06.190 --> 00:12:08.330
It's practically unhurt.

00:12:09.100 --> 00:12:11.720
But it ain't immortal.

00:12:12.250 --> 00:12:13.300
Here goes.

00:12:32.480 --> 00:12:33.290
Lilim!

00:12:52.170 --> 00:12:53.540
Byakko?

00:12:58.340 --> 00:12:59.640
Hinako!

00:13:01.570 --> 00:13:04.310
Hibiki. Aren't you the rear guard?

00:13:04.860 --> 00:13:07.050
I can't turn my back on everyone!

00:13:07.050 --> 00:13:09.180
What are you sayin'? Go back now!

00:13:09.680 --> 00:13:11.780
That's moot if we beat it here!

00:13:12.230 --> 00:13:13.100
Byakko!

00:13:28.830 --> 00:13:31.980
What?! Electricity won't work?

00:13:44.560 --> 00:13:45.510
Byakko!

00:13:50.190 --> 00:13:50.980
Look out!

00:13:51.420 --> 00:13:53.100
No! Protect Byakko!

00:13:56.230 --> 00:13:57.190
Hibiki!

00:14:43.740 --> 00:14:44.870
Hinako!

00:14:50.610 --> 00:14:54.740
Hibiki... Wasn't Nitta with you?

00:14:56.040 --> 00:14:56.950
Huh? Nitta?

00:14:57.840 --> 00:15:01.840
Oh. Y'all passed each other, huh?

00:15:03.000 --> 00:15:04.530
So dumb.

00:15:05.630 --> 00:15:06.590
Hinako!

00:15:16.750 --> 00:15:19.520
Merak is 500 marks from the
Shinsaibashi Defensive Line!

00:15:19.820 --> 00:15:22.880
Don't stop attacking! Finish it here!

00:15:22.880 --> 00:15:23.820
Roger!

00:15:23.820 --> 00:15:25.700
Merak has reached the road!

00:15:26.660 --> 00:15:27.740
Sir!

00:15:29.200 --> 00:15:30.620
You all right?

00:15:32.410 --> 00:15:36.100
Thanks to your powerful demon,
only you were saved, eh?

00:15:37.500 --> 00:15:38.960
Ah, yes.

00:15:39.740 --> 00:15:41.460
"Nice to meet you," I should say.

00:15:42.590 --> 00:15:44.250
Who are you?

00:15:44.630 --> 00:15:45.720
Alcor.

00:15:46.540 --> 00:15:49.510
I'm Yamato Hotsuin's... Well.

00:15:50.030 --> 00:15:52.270
His old friend, I guess.

00:15:54.480 --> 00:15:57.390
I see. So this is how it is.

00:15:58.270 --> 00:15:59.740
I couldn't help them.

00:16:00.200 --> 00:16:01.730
Couldn't help them?

00:16:02.350 --> 00:16:04.880
Looks to me like you've
been dragged into this.

00:16:04.880 --> 00:16:07.400
Dragged? Me?

00:16:08.260 --> 00:16:10.610
That girl protected you.

00:16:11.440 --> 00:16:14.610
And the other one's trying
to fight right now.

00:16:15.120 --> 00:16:16.280
"Other one"?

00:16:16.750 --> 00:16:18.910
The human that came with you.

00:16:19.470 --> 00:16:21.880
We're counting on your Summoner powers.

00:16:22.350 --> 00:16:25.550
Ma'am. Um, and Kuze?

00:16:26.240 --> 00:16:27.380
He--

00:16:27.380 --> 00:16:30.410
He's fine. Just concentrate
on the fight.

00:16:32.470 --> 00:16:33.210
Sir.

00:16:35.330 --> 00:16:38.100
It can't be! Nitta?!

00:16:38.410 --> 00:16:41.480
Looks like she's fighting in your place.

00:16:41.770 --> 00:16:42.940
No!

00:16:43.450 --> 00:16:45.610
It's because of YOUR choice, yes?

00:16:46.730 --> 00:16:52.330
Those with power tend to
influence the ones around them.

00:16:58.540 --> 00:16:59.240
Huh.

00:17:00.590 --> 00:17:02.840
What's making you do that?

00:17:03.290 --> 00:17:05.270
Cries. Screams.

00:17:05.830 --> 00:17:09.210
If this can solve things, I'll do it.

00:17:09.720 --> 00:17:12.970
I see. An interesting thought.

00:17:13.850 --> 00:17:18.730
Why, amongst people who do nothing,
do you choose to act?

00:17:19.850 --> 00:17:22.220
Because I've acquired this power.

00:17:22.980 --> 00:17:24.480
I want to run away.

00:17:25.900 --> 00:17:26.940
But!

00:17:50.130 --> 00:17:52.520
Since the metro accident,

00:17:52.520 --> 00:17:57.380
I couldn't have done anything if not for you.

00:17:58.280 --> 00:18:00.630
I think all I've done is cry.

00:18:01.650 --> 00:18:03.790
That won't do, will it?

00:18:04.320 --> 00:18:07.310
Like you, Kuze, I want to...

00:18:08.110 --> 00:18:08.980
Try hard!

00:18:15.940 --> 00:18:17.780
The goddess Kikuri-Hime?!

00:18:18.530 --> 00:18:20.370
Who are those guys?

00:18:20.920 --> 00:18:21.830
Nitta!

00:18:21.830 --> 00:18:22.530
Ma'am.

00:18:23.490 --> 00:18:24.570
Kikuri-Hime!

00:18:43.480 --> 00:18:45.100
Cover Kikuri-Hime!

00:18:53.880 --> 00:18:55.030
Kikuri-Hime!

00:19:28.150 --> 00:19:29.100
Oh, no!

00:19:48.290 --> 00:19:49.400
Hibiki.

00:19:50.460 --> 00:19:52.000
Hibiki!

00:19:57.500 --> 00:20:00.010
Merak's magical readings
are increasing further!

00:20:00.560 --> 00:20:02.590
This is our chance, while
the enemy is vulnerable.

00:20:02.590 --> 00:20:03.430
Finish it!

00:20:49.680 --> 00:20:52.600
Hibiki. You did it.

00:20:53.730 --> 00:20:55.750
Merak is silent.

00:20:55.750 --> 00:20:58.230
Its readings have disappeared!

00:21:00.910 --> 00:21:05.830
Where will the possibilities
of his choosing lead?

00:21:06.790 --> 00:21:07.780
Kuze.

00:21:08.210 --> 00:21:12.290
Hibiki... That's it. You did good.

00:21:12.680 --> 00:21:15.290
Hibiki. You did it?

00:21:37.470 --> 00:21:39.240
Keep your guard up till it's finished.

00:21:40.990 --> 00:21:42.160
Who are you?

00:21:42.160 --> 00:21:44.240
Someone who resents JP's.

00:21:45.660 --> 00:21:49.490
Sir! JP's Nagoya Branch has
been forcibly seized!

00:21:49.830 --> 00:21:50.830
What?

00:21:51.520 --> 00:21:55.100
The mastermind is Ronaldo Kuriki,
former JP's team member!

00:21:55.920 --> 00:21:58.790
Yamato Hotsuin is dangerous.

00:22:01.150 --> 00:22:04.870
I'd like you to come with
me, Mr. Hibiki Kuze.

00:22:07.050 --> 00:22:08.310
Mission complete.

00:22:08.310 --> 00:22:10.810
All team members, return at once.

00:22:12.980 --> 00:22:14.290
Hibiki?

00:22:15.570 --> 00:22:17.280
Osaka to Tokyo Branch.

00:22:17.280 --> 00:22:19.440
There's no trace of Hibiki Kuze.

00:22:19.900 --> 00:22:22.630
What do you mean?
What's going on?!

00:22:26.540 --> 00:22:28.250
Hibiki!

00:24:02.170 --> 00:24:03.380
You don't know anything,
yet you all would...

00:24:03.380 --> 00:24:05.680
Hey! That's Hibiki, right? Where did he go?
You don't know anything, yet you all would...

00:24:05.680 --> 00:24:09.600
The violent spiritual energy that has
overtaken the Nagoya Branch...

00:24:09.600 --> 00:24:10.510
Eat some chawanmushi.

00:24:10.510 --> 00:24:11.020
It's delicious.

00:24:11.020 --> 00:24:12.930
The pledge you are bound to...

00:24:12.930 --> 00:24:17.100
Well, maybe humans have the
will to think for themselves.

00:24:17.100 --> 00:24:18.230
It's only just begun.

00:24:18.230 --> 00:24:19.570
Nothing has begun yet.

00:24:19.570 --> 00:24:20.360
It's Cerberus!

00:24:20.360 --> 00:24:22.280
You think Hibiki can win?

00:24:22.280 --> 00:24:24.020
Burn it.
